  "description": "\nMichael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to present to the rental market this nice 3-bedroom property located in the hugely popular development of Dun Eoin, Carrigaline.\n\nThis property is in great condition throughout and has a spacious living and bedroom accommodation, private enclosed rear garden and parking to the front.\n\nAccommodation: Ground Floor - Entrance hall, living room, guest wc, kitchen/dining/utility room. First Floor - Bedroom 1, en suite, bedroom 2, bedroom 3, bathroom.\n\nThe property is most conveniently located just minutes from a host of amenities and services in Carrigaline Town Centre and is just a short drive to Douglas. It is also just a short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport, Ringaskiddy and has the benefit of having easy access to a regular public bus service available close by.\n\n**Viewing comes highly recommended**\n\n",
